2026-10-18T18:38:55.9236795Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9321045Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9330167Z [0m
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9330802Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9331612Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9331796Z 
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9331976Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9332918Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9333393Z 
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9333768Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9334302Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9334545Z 
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9335016Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9335703Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9336123Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9336437Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9336583Z 
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9336748Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9336969Z 
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9337143Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9337469Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9337597Z 
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9337704Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9337845Z 
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9338093Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9338472Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9340769Z 
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9340904Z I will:
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9341282Z 
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9341683Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9342231Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9342763Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9343333Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9343724Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9344093Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9344602Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9345304Z    /root
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9353719Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9354371Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9363511Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9364037Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9364372Z 
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9365232Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-18T18:38:55.9365692Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
